The [[Serpent Staff]] is a neutral [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Magic Staff]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]], although Mages with the [[Rainbow Potion]] can also find it in the shop. It is the only class-neutral upgraded [[Magic Staff]]. It does slightly more default damage than the [[Magic Staff]], but costs more {{icon/mana}} to activate its effect, which also gains it less permanent damage. Thankfully, activating this effect also inflicts {{icon/poison}} equal to a quarter of the damage. The [[Serpent Staff]] also grants a massive 40% chance of duplicating any {{icon/poison}} inflicted on the opponent through any means, including its own ability. Naturally, this makes it incredible for any {{icon/poison}} build, although, like all [[Staff|staves]], a steady supply of {{icon/mana}} is needed to get the most out of it.
